# Patterns excluded from the Docker build context for docker/Dockerfile.
# Goals: (1) keep `COPY . .` from invalidating on noise like editor cruft,
# (2) trim the context transferred to buildx (cost is amplified under
# QEMU emulation), (3) avoid copying directories that are pure waste in
# a Go-build context (prior build artifacts and coverage).
#
# Notes:
# - The top-level `.git/` is not needed inside the builder. VERSION/
#   GIT_COMMIT/BUILD_DATE are injected via Docker build-args from the
#   docker-publish.yml workflow (which runs `git describe` on the host),
#   not from `git describe` inside the builder.
# Top-level VCS state.
/.git
/.gitattributes
/.gitignore
/.gitmodules

# Build artifacts.
/bin/
/coverage.out
/coverage.html

# Test fixtures and developer docs — not consumed by the Dockerfile.
# (NOTE: do NOT exclude `/web/` — `cmd/frpc/main.go` blank-imports
# `web/frpc`, which `go:embed`s `web/frpc/dist` into the binary.)
/tests/
/docs/

# Docs / repo metadata not consumed by the Dockerfile.
/README.md
/CHANGELOG.md
/CONTRIBUTING.md
/LICENSE
/SECURITY.md
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
/.github/

# Editor / OS / agent cruft.
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.claude/
